tests: cover the patch series with Wine's own test suite

One regression test per patch that changes Wine code, in that module's dlls/<module>/tests/
suite and wired into START_TEST, so that reverting the patch makes the test fail.  The patches
themselves are not modified; this patch only adds the tests.  Each test was run against the
patched and the pristine code of its module and the failing assertions are the ones the patch
is about (see tools/run_wine_tests.sh).

Modules: advapi32 kernelbase (0002), crypt32 (0007), dnsapi/kernel32/ntdll (0010),
kernel32 (0008), ntdll (0009), secur32 (0014), urlmon (0003), wintrust (0001), ws2_32 (0006, 0012).
Also covers the Revit-only extra 0102 (dlls/dxgi/tests/dxgi.c).
